3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold font-playfair text-center mb-12 text-white">Gift a PrayerSong to a Loved One, or to Yourself!</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-12"><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden h-32 md:h-40 cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200"><img src="https://cdn.prayersong.com/lander-assets/testimonials/testimonial-vid-2.jpg" alt="For Your Partner" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-3 md:p-4"><h3 class="text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold font-playfair text-center">For Your Partner</h3></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden h-32 md:h-40 cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200"><img src="https://cdn.prayersong.com/lander-assets/testimonials/testimonial-video-5.jpg" alt="For Children" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-3 md:p-4"><h3 class="text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold font-playfair text-center">For Children</h3></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden h-32 md:h-40 cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200"><img src="https://cdn.prayersong.com/lander-assets/for-images/for-loss-2.jpeg" alt="For Loss" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-3 md:p-4"><h3 class="text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold font-playfair text-center">For Loss</h3></div></div><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden h-32 md:h-40 cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200"><img src="https://cdn.prayersong.com/lander-assets/testimonials/testimonial-vid-1.jpg" alt="For Parents" cl